# Student + research tooling. Most of this is optional because the heavyweight
# scientific stack adds ~1.5 GB; `--profile full` keeps it, `--profile core`
# drops it and DeltaHub can install it later.
# python3 itself is part of the base image (DeltaHub and deltaos-persistence
# import it), so it is listed in 00-base.list rather than here.
python3-pip
python3-venv
python3-numpy
build-essential
gdb
cmake
ninja-build
clang
nodejs
npm
neovim
# Zotero is not packaged in Debian; DeltaHub offers the Flatpak install.
# Optional scientific / study stack
?python3-scipy
?python3-matplotlib
?python3-pandas
?python3-sympy
?python3-jupyter
?jupyter-notebook
?jupyter-console
?python3-tk
?r-base
?gnuplot
?octave
?texlive-latex-base
?texlive-latex-recommended
?texlive-latex-extra
?texlive-science
?texstudio
?jabref
?anki
?kalgebra
?kgeography
?kstars
?stellarium
?geogebra
?musescore3
?blender
